```

Use the bare name without `/`. If the command fails, surface the error; do not reconstruct the workflow from memory. Everything else about installation â€” the core-vs-lazy split, what `init` refreshes, diagnosis, CI opt-out, and the no-CLI fallback â€” lives in `references/skill-lifecycle.md`.

